{"id":70554,"date":"2026-10-23T16:45:47","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:45:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70554"},"modified":"2026-10-23T16:49:37","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:49:37","slug":"transpeneda-geres","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/transpeneda-geres\/","title":{"rendered":"TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027<\/strong> (TPG) realiza-se de <strong>28 a 30 de maio de 2027<\/strong> (sexta-feira a domingo), tendo como palco o cora\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Parque Nacional da Peneda-Ger\u00eas<\/strong>, entre a <strong>Vila do Ger\u00eas<\/strong> (Terras de Bouro) e o <strong>Castelo de Montalegre<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Montalegre<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Vila Real<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com os Munic\u00edpios de Terras de Bouro e de Montalegre, este emblem\u00e1tico evento nasceu do Campeonato do Mundo de Trail de 2016 e integra o circuito <strong>Best Trail Series<\/strong>, o <strong>Circuito Nacional da ATRP<\/strong> e a pontua\u00e7\u00e3o internacional <strong>ITRA e UTMB<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o estende-se por quatro desafios de montanha em regime de semi-autonomia: o <strong>TPG 110 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>06:00<\/strong> de s\u00e1bado na Vila do Ger\u00eas rumo a Montalegre, com tempo limite de <strong>26h00<\/strong> e bases de vida na Vila do Ger\u00eas ao Km 40 e em Paradela ao Km 80), o <strong>TPG 60 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> de s\u00e1bado em <strong>Fafi\u00e3o<\/strong> com chegada a Montalegre), o <strong>TPG 40 km<\/strong> (percurso circular com in\u00edcio e fim na Vila do Ger\u00eas, partida \u00e0s <strong>06:00<\/strong> e tempo limite de <strong>11h00<\/strong>) e o <strong>TPG 17 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong> na aldeia hist\u00f3rica de <strong>Pit\u00f5es das J\u00fanias<\/strong> at\u00e9 ao Castelo de Montalegre).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O secretariado abre na sexta-feira (28 de maio, das <strong>18:00 \u00e0s 21:00<\/strong>) no centro da Vila do Ger\u00eas para todas as dist\u00e2ncias, prosseguindo no s\u00e1bado na Vila do Ger\u00eas (<strong>05:00\u201306:00<\/strong> para os 110 km e 40 km) e no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Montalegre<\/strong> (<strong>07:00\u201308:00<\/strong> para os 60 km e <strong>13:00\u201315:00<\/strong> para os 17 km). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, brinde oficial, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos sem copos descart\u00e1veis, medalha de finalista, refei\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova, banhos e seguro desportivo, existindo ainda transferes opcionais de autocarro a partir de Montalegre para as partidas na Vila do Ger\u00eas (+10 \u20ac), Fafi\u00e3o (+10 \u20ac) e Pit\u00f5es das J\u00fanias (+5 \u20ac). Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">28 a 30 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Conce