34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Promocional:<\/strong> 60.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/09\/2026 a 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 70.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10\/2026 a 25\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 75.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26\/04\/2027 a 21\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Longo<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TPG 40 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 29 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Promocional:<\/strong> 40.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/09\/2026 a 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 50.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10\/2026 a 25\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 55.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26\/04\/2027 a 21\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TPG 17 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 29 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Promocional:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/09\/2026 a 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10\/2026 a 25\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26\/04\/2027 a 21\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027 realiza-se de 28 a 30 de maio de 2027 no Parque Nacional da Peneda-Ger\u00eas, ligando os munic\u00edpios de Terras de Bouro (Vila do Ger\u00eas e Fafi\u00e3o) e Montalegre (Pit\u00f5es das J\u00fanias e Castelo de Montalegre).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida das quatro dist\u00e2ncias?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as provas partem no s\u00e1bado, 29 de maio de 2027: os 110 km (rumo a Montalegre) e os 40 km (circular) partem \u00e0s 06:00 no centro da Vila do Ger\u00eas; os 60 km partem \u00e0s 10:00 em Fafi\u00e3o (rumo a Montalegre); e os 17 km partem \u00e0s 16:00 em Pit\u00f5es das J\u00fanias com chegada ao Castelo de Montalegre.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s a Fase Promocional (15 a 30 de setembro de 2026), decorre a 1\u00aa Fase (1 de outubro de 2026 a 25 de abril de 2027: 115 \u20ac nos 110 km, 70 \u20ac nos 60 km, 50 \u20ac nos 40 km e 25 \u20ac nos 17 km) e a 2\u00aa Fase (26 de abril a 21 de maio de 2027: 120 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac, 55 \u20ac e 30 \u20ac, respetivamente).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e existem autocarros para as partidas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado abre na sexta-feira (28 de maio, 18:00\u201321:00) na Vila do Ger\u00eas para todas as provas, e no s\u00e1bado funciona na Vila do Ger\u00eas (05:00\u201306:00 para 110 km e 40 km) e no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Montalegre (07:00\u201308:00 para 60 km e 13:00\u201315:00 para 17 km). Existem transferes opcionais desde Montalegre para a Vila do Ger\u00eas (+10 \u20ac), Fafi\u00e3o (+10 \u20ac) e Pit\u00f5es das J\u00fanias (+5 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que material obrigat\u00f3rio \u00e9 exigido aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, apito, reserva alimentar e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel. Nos 60 km acrescem 2 frontais operacionais, e nos 110 km s\u00e3o ainda exigidos sistema GPS com track, casaco imperme\u00e1vel com capuz, camisola t\u00e9rmica de mangas compridas, banda el\u00e1stica adesiva e drop bag.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-28\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-28\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque Nacional da Peneda-Ger\u00eas (Vila do Ger\u00eas e Montalegre)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Montalegre\", \"addressRegion\": \"Vila Real\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O TransPeneda-Ger\u00eas 2027 realiza-se de 28 a 30 de maio entre o Ger\u00eas e Montalegre, com provas de trail de 110 km, 60 km, 40 km e 17 km. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-transpeneda-geres.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TPG 110 km\", \"price\": \"115.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/transpeneda-geres-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TPG 60 km\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/transpeneda-geres-2027\"